    "paras": [
      {
        "text": "Remember who you are",
        "typo": {
          "fontFamily": "\"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, \"Hiragino Kaku Gothic ProN\", \"Hiragino Sans\", Meiryo, sans-serif",
          "fontSize": "16px",
          "fontWeight": "400",
          "lineHeight": "normal",
          "letterSpacing": "normal",
          "color": "rgb(217, 215, 212)",
          "textTransform": "none"
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "Sharing the Japanese Spirit of Harmony",
        "typo": {
          "fontFamily": "\"Helvetica Neue\", Arial, \"Hiragino Kaku Gothic ProN\", \"Hiragino Sans\", Meiryo, sans-serif",
          "fontSize": "16px",
          "fontWeight": "400",
          "lineHeight": "normal",
          "letterSpacing": "normal",
          "color": "rgb(217, 215, 212)",
          "textTransform": "none"
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "調和とは「作り出すもの」ではなく「思い出すもの」。Izanamiは日本に受け継がれる和の精神を通して",
        "typo": {
          "fontFamily": "\"Shippori Mincho\", serif",
          "fontSize": "14.4px",
          "fontWeight": "400",
          "lineHeight": "34.56px",
          "letterSpacing": "normal",
          "color": "rgb(217, 215, 212)",
          "textTransform": "none"
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "Designing the Dimensions of Life",
        "typo": {
          "fontFamily": "\"Playfair Display\", serif",
          "fontSize": "45px",
          "fontWeight": "400",
          "lineHeight": "45px",
          "letterSpacing": "normal",
          "color": "rgb(217, 215, 212)",
          "textTransform": "none"
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "Izanamiは、3つの事業を通して、人生における調和をデザインします。いかに命を育み、暮らしを輝か",
        "typo": {
          "fontFamily": "\"Shippori Mincho\", serif",
          "fontSize": "14.4px",
          "fontWeight": "400",
          "lineHeight": "34.56px",
          "letterSpacing": "normal",
          "color": "rgb(217, 215, 212)",
          "textTransform": "none"
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "「0歳からのママスクール®」というブランドで日本全国2万人以上の親子をサポート。親と子どもの「願い」",
        "typo": {
          "fontFamily": "\"Shippori Mincho\", serif",
          "fontSize": "14.4px",
          "fontWeight": "400",
          "lineHeight": "28.8px",
          "letterSpacing": "normal",
          "color": "rgb(217, 215, 212)",
          "textTransform": "none"
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "日本の美意識で、感覚を呼び戻す。",
        "typo": {
          "fontFamily": "\"Shippori Mincho\", serif",
          "fontSize": "18px",
          "fontWeight": "400",
          "lineHeight": "32.4px",
          "letterSpacing": "normal",
          "color": "rgb(217, 215, 212)",
          "textTransform": "none"
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "日本の美意識を現代のラグジュアリーへと翻訳し、唯一無二のプロダクトや空間をデザイン。ドバイを中心に、",
        "typo": {
          "fontFamily": "\"Shippori Mincho\", serif",
          "fontSize": "14.4px",
          "fontWeight": "400",
          "lineHeight": "28.8px",
          "letterSpacing": "normal",
          "color": "rgb(217, 215, 212)",
          "textTransform": "none"
        }
      }
    ],
